      "content": "For stabilizing your blood sugar levels in the afternoon, consider combining carbs with healthy fats and proteins. Some effective snacks might include a handful of nuts with a piece of fruit, a slice of whole-grain toast with almond butter, or yogurt with a bit of honey and granola. These combinations not only slow food absorption but also provide sustained energy and keep you satiated throughout the day. Remember, staying hydrated and moving regularly can also help manage energy levels and blood sugar.",
